        "main.js": {
            "ast": [
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "<p>As of Obsidian 1.4, the new Properties view supports the internal file syntax,\n        which makes it more straightforward to use local images as banners.</p> <p>Because of this,\n        <b>Banners 2.0 will no longer use the previous syntax for local images</b>\n        (<code>&quot;![[filename]]&quot;</code>).\n        If you used Banners 1.x in the past, this modal can facillitate this change\n        by scanning all of your notes in your vault for the legacy source syntax\n        and update it appropriately (at least to the best of its ability).</p> <p class=\"mod-warning\"><b>Warning:</b> this process will check the frontmatter of <b>all</b> your files and\n        make changes to files with the legacy syntax. This should be safe, but may take a bit\n        and backing up your files beforehand is always good.</p>",
                    "target": "作为 Obsidian 1.4 版本中的新功能，全新的“属性 (Properties)”视图支持内部文件语法，这使得将本地图片用作横幅变得更加直接。因此，Banners 2.0 将不再对本地图片使用之前的语法（&quot;![[filename]]&quot;）。如果你过去使用过 Banners 1.x，此弹窗可以通过扫描你库（Vault）中的所有笔记来帮助你完成这项更改，以查找旧版源语法并对其进行相应的更新（尽最大可能）。<p class=\"mod-warning\"><b>警告：</b>此过程将检查你<b>所有</b>文件的 frontmatter（前置元数据），并对带有旧版语法的文件进行更改。这应该是安全的，但可能会花费一点时间，并且事先备份你的文件总是一个好习惯。</p>"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "Adjust the banner width to only be as wide as the <em>readable line length</em>, which is used\n    by Obsidian&#39;s <b>Readable line length</b> setting. It is recommended to toggle this together\n    with that setting.",
                    "target": "将横幅宽度调整为与<em>可读行长度</em>（readable line length）一样宽，Obsidian 的<b>可读行长度</b>设置使用的就是该值。建议将此开关与该设置一起开启或关闭。"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "Set a modifier key that must be used to drag a banner.\n    <br/>\n    For example, setting it to <b>\\u21E7 Shift</b> means you must hold down <b>Shift</b> in order to\n    move a banner by dragging it. This can help avoid accidental banner movements.",
                    "target": "设置一个拖动横幅时必须使用的修饰键。\n<br/>\n例如，将其设置为 <b>\\u21E7 Shift</b> 意味着你必须按住 <b>Shift</b> 才能通过拖拽来移动横幅。这有助于避免意外移动横幅。"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "Display the banner in the internal file embed. This is the embed that appears when you\n    write <code>![[file]]</code> in a file.\n    <br/> <b>Note:</b> You might need to reload Obsidian after toggling this setting",
                    "target": "在内部文件嵌入中显示横幅。这是当你在文件中写入 <code>![[file]]</code> 时出现的嵌入内容。\n<br/> <b>注意：</b>切换此设置后，你可能需要重新加载 Obsidian。"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "Display the banner in the page preview popover. This is the preview that appears from the\n    <em>Page Preview</em> core plugin.",
                    "target": "在页面预览弹窗中显示横幅。这是由<em>页面预览</em>核心插件生成的预览。"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "Enable and display the lock button on the corner of a banner. When combined with the\n    <b>Banner drag modifier key</b> setting, it might be desirable to disable this.",
                    "target": "启用并在横幅角落显示锁定按钮。当与<b>横幅拖动修饰键</b>设置结合使用时，可能最好禁用此选项。"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "Though personally, I like setting it to <code>2.5em</code>",
                    "target": "不过就个人而言，我喜欢把它设置为 <code>2.5em</code>"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "<em>Note:</em> this setting stacks with the <b>Header font size</b> setting above",
                    "target": "<em>注意：</em>此设置会与上方的 <b>标题字体大小</b> 设置叠加。"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "Use <a href=\"https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Twemoji</a>\n    instead of your device&#39;s native emoji set. Makes emojis consistent across devices",
                    "target": "使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Twemoji</a> 替代你设备原生的表情符号集。这能让表情符号在不同设备上保持一致。"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "Limit how many suggestions to display in this modal.\n    <br/> <em>Note:</em> setting a high number while <b>Show preview images</b> setting is toggled on\n    may cause slowdowns",
                    "target": "限制此弹窗中显示的推荐建议数量。\n<br/> <em>注意：</em>在开启<b>显示预览图像</b>设置的情况下设置较高的数值，可能会导致运行缓慢。"
                },
                {
                    "type": "AssignmentExpression",
                    "name": "innerHTML",
                    "source": "If enabled, the <b>Paste banner from clipboard</b> command will automatically download the\n    image from the URL into your vault and link it as an internal file. Great if you want to\n    keep some banners you found online!\n    <br/>\n    If you want to download them on a case-by-case basis though, you can use the\n    <b>Download banner in note to vault</b> command for a note with a remote banner URL.",
